The enrichment fetch is not included. This node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`. An HTTP fetch would need `aap:caps/http-client`, which this node was not granted. Adding it would also send the user's question to an outside endpoint. If you need enrichment, it should be its own graph node that holds an `HTTPClient` capability.

